# Digital Marketing Course — Project Context

## Who and why

The platform user writes **digital marketing (DM) course assignments, reports, class activities, and campaign plans** here.

Accessible Publishers Limited chose **practical expert training** instead of hiring an external digital marketer. The goal is for the user to become **Chief Digital Marketer (Chief DM)** for the group and all subsidiaries. Training is hands-on and fast-paced — help them learn quickly, apply concepts to real brands, and produce submission-ready work.

**Do not assume the user is Gbadega Adedapo** — that name belongs to specific seed documents only (see project-context rule).

## Terminology

- **DM = Digital Marketing** (always; not direct message).
- When the user says "assignment", "class activity", "report", or "campaign", treat it as DM coursework unless clearly about the DBA dissertation.

